---
/* -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
   Intensive Outpatient (IOP)

   IMPORTANT — read before editing the copy on this page.

   The client wiki lists IOP as an active level of care. The call export
   (CallTrackingMetrics, Jan–Jul 2026, 4,030 calls) contradicts that. Across 122
   calls mentioning IOP, six different Buena Vista agents state on the record
   that we do not have one:

     Elizabeth Pruitt  "We actually don't have an IOP program currently."
     Clay Williams     "We don't have IOP right now. We do plan to have one,
                        but it's a little bit down the road."
     Carlos Armenta    "We don't have outpatient at our facility. However, our
                        sister company does."
     Michael Montoya   "Buena Vista, we don't have our IOP program open just yet."
     Hailey Jones      "We haven't gotten our IOP up and running just yet."

   Every affirmative "we offer IOP" quote in the export belongs to a different
   PIR brand (Revive, Plugged In Recovery, Mosaic Minds) — the export covers all
   of them, not just Buena Vista. The residential page's own FAQ comment already
   flags "IOP availability" as unverified.

   So this page does NOT claim we run an IOP. It ranks for the term, tells the
   truth about availability, and captures the demand as a referral — which is
   what admissions already does on the phone. It is noindex until availability
   is confirmed either way.

   WHEN THE IOP OPENS: drop the hero disclosure and IopHelpNow, replace with real
   program detail (schedule, group structure, length), remove noindex, and flip
   `built: true` in src/data/navigation.ts.
----------------------------------------------------------------------------- */
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import TopBar from '../../components/TopBar.astro';
import Nav from '../../components/Nav.astro';

import IopHero from '../../components/iop/IopHero.astro';
import WhatIsIop from '../../components/iop/WhatIsIop.astro';
import IopHelpNow from '../../components/iop/IopHelpNow.astro';
import IopQuestions from '../../components/iop/IopQuestions.astro';
import IopFaq from '../../components/iop/IopFaq.astro';

import VerifySection from '../../components/VerifySection.astro';
import FinalCTA from '../../components/FinalCTA.astro';

const title = 'Intensive Outpatient (IOP) in Chandler, AZ | Buena Vista Health & Recovery';
const description =
  'What intensive outpatient treatment involves, and how it fits after detox and residential. Our Chandler IOP is not open yet — we will help you find one that takes your insurance. Call (888) 362-5576.';
---
<Layout title={title} description={description} noindex={true}>
  <TopBar />
  <Nav />

  <IopHero />
  <WhatIsIop />
  <IopHelpNow />
  <IopQuestions />
  <VerifySection />
  <IopFaq />

  <FinalCTA />
</Layout>
